Using psionic forces you maintain in place on your back two giant horrific mechanical arms.

Each basic turn (as if you had 100% speed) they can automatically attack up to 2 foes within range 3 with a mindstar attack doing [91%, 104%, 114%, 122%, 130% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

Creatures harassed by the mechanical arms have their damage reduced by [6%, 16%, 22%, 26%, 29% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.
